<title>UK: Sept IPE gas oil delivery 155,300 tonnes.</title>
<headline>Sept IPE gas oil delivery 155,300 tonnes.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Physical delivery against the IPE September gas oil futures contract will be 1,553 lots, or 155,300 tonnes, the IPE said on Thursday.</p>
<p>The delivery is higher than in August when it totalled 116,900 tonnes.</p>
<p>The highest delivery volume ever recorded occurred in January and was for 853,600 tonnes, while the May delivery volume of 12,600 tonnes was the lowest ever.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom, +44 171 542 7714</p>
</text>
